  "description": "After receiving a scathing text from his roommate, Geon-Pil is puzzled but unperturbed when said roommate returns radically changed. The new “Yeon-Seung,” driven by a primal, insatiable hunger, takes his friends-with-benefits relationship with Geon-Pil to the extreme to sate himself. As their physical encounters grow increasingly intense and feral, Geon-Pil slowly realizes that something is amiss. Even as whispers of danger warn him to back off, Geon-Pil finds himself growing comfortable with this strangely honest, dangerous new version of his partner… who just might devour him whole. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
